---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Index Prototype — bridge-work.ai">
  <section>
    <div class="kick">Reference build · the prototype the system is derived from</div>
    <h1>Index prototype.</h1>
    <p class="lead">The canonical landing-page prototype — choreographed intro, logo-anchored breathing hero field, sticky-aside Focus, unified-field Formats, pictogram iconography. The HTML lives at <code>public/prototype/index.html</code>; drop the latest export there. This is the visual reference every component traces back to.</p>
    <div class="note"><b>To embed:</b> place the prototype HTML at <code>public/prototype/index.html</code> and it renders below at full fidelity.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:16/10;background:var(--surface)">
      <iframe src="/prototype/index.html" title="Index prototype" style="width:100%;height:100%;border:0" loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
